OL,3,GNEWSA'Some people would not eat without
OL,4,Aour food bank'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA volunteer at a charity that supports
OL,7,Fpeople in times of crisis says that
OL,8,Fwithout its interventions, many would
OL,9,Fnot "eat that day".
OL,11,FScott Fisher gives up his time to help
OL,12,Fat Restore Northampton, a Christian
OL,13,Fcharity that runs Northampton Food
OL,14,FBank.
OL,16,FIt has just been awarded the King's
OL,17,FAward for Voluntary Service ` the
OL,18,Fhighest award a local voluntary group
OL,19,Fcan receive in the UK.
